# Use Jobs from TypeScript

Declare private service queues on the participant:

```trellis
participant "acme.orders-service@v1" service {
  implements "acme.orders@v1";
  job reconcile {
    payload ReconcileInput;
    result ReconcileOutput;
  }
}
```

Generate the project, connect the service with the generated participant, and use the generated queue handle. Jobs remain service-private execution; caller-visible workflows use operations.
